    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845420/extras/feec340aabd459d06231aab591c7c85e.poster.avif?t=1754167041\" width=610 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845420/extras/feec340aabd459d06231aab591c7c85e.webm?t=1754167041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845420/extras/feec340aabd459d06231aab591c7c85e.mp4?t=1754167041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surviving on the streets isn\u2019t easy...<br>Some days you\u2019ll chase a hot meal, other days you\u2019ll survive on a dry cardboard.  <br>You\u2019ve got nothing no home, no job, no guarantees. But this city can be your playground!  <br>Make money through recycling, beg from people, push boundaries, even steal.  <br>Feed yourself, stay clean, and maybe try your luck in an arcade.  <br>Plan your days, find shelter at night.  <br>Survival here is not just physical it\u2019s a mental challenge.  <br>How far can you go in this fight to survive?</p><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845420/extras/b47268d7bcb3cdf7411d037f065a089a.poster.avif?t=1754167041\" width=610 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845420/extras/b47268d7bcb3cdf7411d037f065a089a.webm?t=1754167041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845420/extras/b47268d7bcb3cdf7411d037f065a089a.mp4?t=1754167041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd52 24 Hour Day Cycle &amp; A Large Map to Explore</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This city reveals a new face every hour. Start working in the morning, find a safe spot at night.  <br>Manage your time well money is always needed to survive in this sprawling city!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u267b\ufe0f Recycling System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trash isn\u2019t just waste it\u2019s survival.  <br>Gather bottles, cans, scrap, and sell them at recycling centers to earn money.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udd32 Begging Mechanic</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes asking for help is your only option. Approach people and ask for cash or food.  <br>Be warned not everyone here is kind. Some will ignore you, others may demand more.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd76\ufe0f Theft System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seems unethical? Maybe. But the streets are ruthless.  <br>Be cunning and discreet a wallet or some food could keep you going another day.  <br>But if you're caught, the police won\u2019t show mercy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddfc Pollution &amp; Cleanliness</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Street life gets you dirty. People judge by appearance.  <br>Staying clean improves social interactions. Public restrooms, fountains, and opportunities await.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfb0 Arcades &amp; Casino</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival isn\u2019t only physical it\u2019s mental too.  <br>Unwind in city arcades with mini games. Maybe fortune will favor you.  <br>Are you willing to take the risk?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845420/extras/feec340aabd459d06231aab591c7c85e.poster.avif?t=1754167041\" width=610 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845420/extras/feec340aabd459d06231aab591c7c85e.webm?t=1754167041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845420/extras/feec340aabd459d06231aab591c7c85e.mp4?t=1754167041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surviving on the streets isn\u2019t easy...<br>Some days you\u2019ll chase a hot meal, other days you\u2019ll survive on a dry cardboard.  <br>You\u2019ve got nothing no home, no job, no guarantees. But this city can be your playground!  <br>Make money through recycling, beg from people, push boundaries, even steal.  <br>Feed yourself, stay clean, and maybe try your luck in an arcade.  <br>Plan your days, find shelter at night.  <br>Survival here is not just physical it\u2019s a mental challenge.  <br>How far can you go in this fight to survive?</p><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845420/extras/b47268d7bcb3cdf7411d037f065a089a.poster.avif?t=1754167041\" width=610 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845420/extras/b47268d7bcb3cdf7411d037f065a089a.webm?t=1754167041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845420/extras/b47268d7bcb3cdf7411d037f065a089a.mp4?t=1754167041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd52 24 Hour Day Cycle &amp; A Large Map to Explore</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This city reveals a new face every hour. Start working in the morning, find a safe spot at night.  <br>Manage your time well money is always needed to survive in this sprawling city!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u267b\ufe0f Recycling System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trash isn\u2019t just waste it\u2019s survival.  <br>Gather bottles, cans, scrap, and sell them at recycling centers to earn money.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udd32 Begging Mechanic</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes asking for help is your only option. Approach people and ask for cash or food.  <br>Be warned not everyone here is kind. Some will ignore you, others may demand more.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd76\ufe0f Theft System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seems unethical? Maybe. But the streets are ruthless.  <br>Be cunning and discreet a wallet or some food could keep you going another day.  <br>But if you're caught, the police won\u2019t show mercy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddfc Pollution &amp; Cleanliness</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Street life gets you dirty. People judge by appearance.  <br>Staying clean improves social interactions. Public restrooms, fountains, and opportunities await.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfb0 Arcades &amp; Casino</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival isn\u2019t only physical it\u2019s mental too.  <br>Unwind in city arcades with mini games. Maybe fortune will favor you.  <br>Are you willing to take the risk?</p>",
    "short_description": "Start from nothing. Scavenge, beg, steal, or hustle your way through the harsh streets of the city. Earn money, manage your hunger, face tough choices, and rise from the cold pavement to reclaim your place in society. Will you survive with dignity or lose yourself in the struggle?",
